<header><p class="enc-kicker">People / group</p><h1 class="enc-title">Al Madhkur</h1></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Al Madhkur were an Arab family settled on the Persian coast who ruled the port of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/bushehr">Bushehr</a> as sheikhs from the mid-18th century under Persian overlordship. They also governed <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/bahrain">Bahrain</a> on behalf of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/persia">Persia</a> until 1783, when the Al <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/khalifa">Khalifa</a> of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/zubarah">Zubarah</a> drove out their governor and took the islands.</p></div>
